# This directory mixes real student data (used for local manual testing)
# with committed synthetic test fixtures. Default to ignoring everything
# here and explicitly allow-list only the fake fixture(s) actually used by
# a checked-in test, so a broad `git add`/`git add -A` can never sweep up
# real student PII by accident.
*
!.gitignore
!sample-excel-roster-fake.csv
